+[DEPLOY.md](DEPLOY.md#authentication).
+
+### 7. Run the checks
+
+```bash
+pytest        # config lives in pyproject.toml
+ruff check .  # lint
+```
+
+No `PYTHONPATH` export is needed: `pythonpath` in `pyproject.toml` covers pytest
+and `prepend_sys_path` in `alembic.ini` covers migrations.
+
+---
+
+## Two policy directories
+
+Comp-Lens runs policy in two places, configured separately. Mixing them up is the
+most common source of confusion:
+
+| Directory | Engine | Format | Env var | Purpose |
+|-----------|--------|--------|---------|---------|
+| `policies/` | detective (`app.policy_as_code`) | YAML | `POLICY_DIR` | Evaluates collected evidence to produce findings and posture. Runs in-process. |
+| `enforcement_policy/` | preventive (OPA behind Envoy) | Rego + `data.json` | `ENFORCEMENT_POLICY_DIR` | Served as a signed bundle at `/enforcement/bundles/complens.tar.gz`; PDPs pull it and return allow/deny on live requests. |
+
+Both describe the same controls: the detective side proves what happened, the
+preventive side stops it happening. See
+[`enforcement_policy/README.md`](enforcement_policy/README.md) for the bundle
+layout and the shadow → enforce switch.
+
