+# Reproductions for AUDIT-2.md
+
+Each script is standalone and runs against the current tree. They use throwaway
+SQLite databases under /tmp and do not touch any committed state.
+
+```bash
+python proofs/p6_unknown_vs_false.py   # Finding 1 — missing telemetry reported as FAIL
+python proofs/p3_evidence_tamper.py    # Finding 2 — record_hash forged without a secret
+python proofs/p3b_contrast.py          # Finding 3 — documents are never signed
+python proofs/p2_audit_tenant.py       # Finding 4 — cross-tenant audit read + write
+python proofs/p1_policy_import.py      # Finding 5 — policy import discards the policy
+python proofs/p5_scheduler.py          # Finding 6 — batch rollback loses run bookkeeping
+python proofs/p7_unbounded.py          # Finding 7 — limit ignored on collection endpoints
+python proofs/p4_evaluator.py          # (negative result) evaluator sandbox holds
+```
+
+`p4_evaluator.py` is included deliberately: it documents 14 attack vectors that
+the expression evaluator handles correctly, so that work is not redone.
