Subject: [PATCH 9/9] chore: exclude proofs/ from lint

The reproduction scripts are audit artifacts, not application code. They are
deliberately compact so the behaviour being demonstrated is the visible part of
each file; holding them to library formatting obscures that and would otherwise
fail the lint gate.

